* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* NOARLS1N - EOM API Active Report List
* XSETHZ  2011-10-27 NOMALL-1069 optimization (created from NOARLS-N)
*
*     Note:  This routine handles all Active Report lists for
*            the list view and straight on read tree view lists.
*            Called from routine NOARLS-N.
*
*            Supported list types:
*               LSA  - lists the active reports of a selected
*                      report definition (from report node)
*               LS   - lists the report definitions containing
*                      active reports (summary from folder node)
*               LS1  - lists the active reports of a selected
*                      report definition (from summary node)
*               LS2  - lists the active reports of a selected
*                      location type All, Browsable, Archived
*               LS3  - internally switched to LS2
*                      Return type is LS3 for normal lists
*                                     LS2 for virtual lists
*
*     Note:  (CF3) The list types LS1 and LS2/LS3 are reworked
*            regarding their grant checking to work in the same
*            way as the partner module NOARLS-N.
*
*
* Maintenance:
* XSETHZ  2001-03-22 created
* XSETGGR 2001-07-10 developed
* XSETHZ  2002-01-12 created
* XSETGGR 2002-04-02 read headers from SYSERR
* XSETHZ  2002-06-04
* XSETGGR 2002-08-23 change check-source
* XSETGGR 2002-09-25 change work with time variables
* XSETGGR 2002-10-28 change numeric fields in list
* XSETGGR 2002-11-12 change CHECK-SOURCE
* XSETGGR 2002-11-14 use new parameter ES-APP-SERVER-LIBRARY
* XSETGGR 2002-11-19 add number of options
* XSETGGR 2002-11-27 read user profile
* sju 03-01-31 p(231843) mail wrong if run number wraps round
* xsetggr 2003-03-10 changes list from folder
* sju     2003-03-18 special  TYPE=AL
* fhi     2005-04-19 NOM31107  Support 7-byte job numbers
* xsetggr 2006-07-31 prevent err-msg 'source not found'
* xsetggr 2007-02-27   new user profile value for archive/revive
* xsetggr 2007-05-09 p(294774) change date/time format in lists
* xsetggr 2007-05-24 NOM3201   Support P11 format run number
* xsetggr 2007-12-11 NRT2768   Display length of binary docs in bytes
* xsetggr 2008-02-10 NRT2774   separate list of archived reports
* xsetggr 2008-02-24 add parm to RBINSZ-N
* xsetggr 2008-03-06 fill options reports from Summary tree view
*                    and change option 'BR' to option 'BB'
* xsetggr 2008-03-11 p(302778) change format of RBINSZ-N parm
* xsetggr 2008-03-17 form right header for summary list of active reps
* xsetggr 2008-05-05 p(304350) read size of binary docs from spool attr.
* XSETHZ  2008-07-23 p(307577) use full name of ES-APP-SERVER-LIBRARY
* fhi     2008-07-24 P307319   restow due to changes in DDM NRM-BUNDLE-CONTENTS
* XSETHZ  2008-11-05 P299405   sort flag from user profile
* XSETHZ  2008-11-27 P311898 correct Summary list
* fhi     2009-05-20 N3463   restow due to extended metadata
* XSETHZ  2009-10-27 N3460   SOURCE/SENDER added
* fhi     2009-12-10 N3460   Use non-opo active-reports view for NOM321
* xsetggr 2009-12-18 N3460   get NOM version with NOMVI--N
* xsetggr 2010-01-03 N3460   integrate NOARLS1N in NOARLS-N
* fhi     2010-02-24 N3460   Non-opo active-reports view only < NOM3300
*                            No tags entered for this change.
* xsetggr 2010-03-01 P321493   check folder grants and owner folder
*                              before funcctions on active reports
* xsetggr 2010-07-07 NOMALL-833 set options from folder grants for NOM32
* fhi     2010-09-03 NOMALL-97 Extend message line
* xsetggr 2010-09-20 NOMALL-870 correct source check and set 'BB' option
* XSETHZ  2010-11-04 NOMALL-880 new filter
* XSETHZ  2010-12-15 NOMALL-907
* xsetggr 2011-03-03 NOMALL-907 change options due to change of source
*                               check
